            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Resolution:</strong> Dual 1080P Full HD (front + rear)</li><li><strong>Lens:</strong> 170° ultra-wide angle front, 150° rear</li><li><strong>Night Vision:</strong> Advanced IR LED night vision (front + rear)</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> WiFi + Bluetooth for app control (iOS & Android)</li><li><strong>Loop Recording:</strong> Auto-overwrites oldest footage when storage is full</li><li><strong>G-Sensor:</strong> Collision detection locks and protects footage automatically</li><li><strong>Parking Mode:</strong> 24/7 parking surveillance mode</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> Supports Class 10 MicroSD up to 128GB</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> Hardwire kit included for parking mode</li></ul>",
